Package: rotationplanner
Title: Volleyball Rotation Matchup Planner
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Local Shiny application for checking, studying and optimising
    volleyball rotation matchups (6-player indoor rules): rotation viewer with
    overlap (positional fault) checking, set matchup analysis with a Markov
    set-win model, and live match tracking.
License: Private (not yet licensed)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: shiny (>= 1.7), DT
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
